.function main 0 16
LOAD_CONST R0 x
LOAD_CONST R1 10
LOAD_CONST R2 g
LOAD_CONST R3 1
HOST_CALL map_new R0 4 R4
LOAD_CONST R5 x
LOAD_CONST R6 20
LOAD_CONST R7 g
LOAD_CONST R8 2
HOST_CALL map_new R5 4 R9
MOVE R5 R9
ARRAY_NEW R10 R4 2
HOST_CALL dataset R10 1 R11
